# Payments Module

> Manage funding, payment approvals, disbursements, and reconciliation for completed mineral acquisitions.

---

# Overview

The Payments module manages the financial settlement of completed mineral acquisitions.

After a Closing has been approved, the Payments module tracks payment requests, approvals, funding, payment methods, reconciliation, and final payment confirmation.

Every payment is linked to its corresponding Deal, Closing, Owner, and Asset to provide complete financial traceability and auditability.

---

# Objectives

The Payments module enables users to:

- Create payment requests
- Track payment approvals
- Process acquisition funding
- Record payment methods
- Monitor payment status
- Reconcile completed payments
- Generate accounting reports
- Maintain financial audit logs

