# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Payments cannot be created until the Closing status is **Closed**.

---

## Rule 2

Net Payment must match the approved Closing Settlement.

---

## Rule 3

Only Accounting may mark a payment as **Paid**.

---

## Rule 4

Cancelled payments require an explanation and manager approval.

---

## Rule 5

Every payment action is recorded in the audit log.

---

## Rule 6

Reconciled payments become read-only.

